    <string name="guide_subtitle">Instructions &amp; technical information for KPK Government employees and DDOs</string>
    <string name="guide_step_1_title">1. Enter the Portal</string>
    <string name="guide_step_1_body">Tap the primary ENTER button on the Home screen to open https://m.pifra.gov.pk/DDOALV directly inside the app.</string>
    <string name="guide_step_2_title">2. DDO / Employee Credentials</string>
    <string name="guide_step_2_body">Sign in using your assigned PIFRA DDO code, CNIC, or personal number as required by the provincial treasury portal.</string>
    <string name="guide_step_3_title">3. External Browser &amp; Printing</string>
    <string name="guide_step_3_body">Use the browser icon in the portal toolbar at any time to open the current page in Chrome or your default browser for PDF downloads.</string>
